   588	    the driver's receipt (its committed-artifact digests and dump evidence), the dump
   589	    (``dump_check`` 'full' = ``is_complete`` once, 'manifest' = marker + manifest, both + the
   590	    receipt's evidence == the dump on disk; 'receipt' = OFFLINE, the receipt's evidence stands
   591	    for the dump, no NAS read), and -- ``check_link`` -- the farm entry's cache identity.
   592	    ``receipt_doc``: a draft receipt verified before it is written. Relative artifact paths
   593	    resolve against ``base_dir`` (the evaluator's cwd)."""
   594	    if not re.fullmatch(r"[0-9a-f]{40}", str(pin)):
   595	        return [f"pin {pin!r} is not a full 40-hex commit"]
