  1315	    theta = 0 pair, identical input_hash). Verdict = every pair's matched rule (its offset's
  1316	    control p99) AND the pooled rule (all pairs' items vs the pooled control p99) AND the 1e-2
  1317	    cap; requiring both readings of "control p99" is the fail-closed resolution. The alarm and
