  1124	def _bf_number_reasons(rep, P):
  1125	    """Every number of the B-F report is RECOMPUTED from its item vectors (Codex C3a BLOCKING 1): each vector holds
  1126	    exactly n_items finite, non-negative values; every summary, the pooled block, the control p99 (per offset and
  1127	    pooled), eps_cond (reported, NO verdict) and the verdict must equal the recomputation -- and the verdict hold."""
